":"47febdd9f8a45735","term":"목소리","zh":"嗓音，声音","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3","entryId":"69464","definition":"从人喉咙里发出的声音。","pronunciation":["목쏘리"]},{"id":"35e71a5db7e3493c","term":"변하다","zh":"变，改变，变成","audio":"/audio/35e71a5db7e3493cf6ff.mp3","entryId":"58881","definition":"成为其他东西或性质发生变动。","pronunciation":["변ː하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/8d6081124f9c07f0be4a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.767,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=32553","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"6","sourceLevel":"중급","day":89,"sequenceScore":2.4204,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不是的，我是感冒了，所以声音才变的。","那个节目不是说这个月的收视率排第一吗？","你为什么突然压低声音啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不是的，我是感冒了，所以声音才变的。","你为什么突然压低声音啊？","那个节目不是说这个月的收视率排第一吗？"],"answer":0}]}
